    "details": {
      "alignment": "Neutral",
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Jory Dobbs.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, generated from the article's own words. XP ledger: level 3, power rating 4 → CR 1/2 as a civilian. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>Hired Off a Noticeboard</strong> — Wario's Enterprise (casual labour, one expedition, agreed share of proceeds: none)</p><p>Status: Last seen 18 Aethel 1032 BF aboard the Wariocopter, scalp wound from the crash still unpaid, heading aft for food after the All Clear. He was nearly twenty-three. The One-T file continues.</p><p>Jory Dobbs answered an advertisement for skilled labour, sat through a briefing at which a chair fell over and a vase was destroyed, was offered no share of the treasure whatsoever, pocketed a forged passport in lieu of wages, and found himself in a taped-together charter flying into a storm with a man in a produce sack. He took a bracket to the head in the crash, bled down one side of his face for the rest of the day, tied every knot in the rope chain correctly, and was the first person to say out loud that they had climbed the wrong mountain.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Club</strong> — “Hired Off a Noticeboard”</li><li><strong>Keen Records</strong> — “Waluigi met Jory Dobbs for eighteen hours and can describe him completely: cheap boots with good laces, a woollen hat that did not survive the cave, a kit-bag containing sandwiches, a spare shirt, one stolen passport”</li><li><strong>Loud</strong> — “He asked, at the briefing, about the stories — that those who go up Mount Ebott fall down and never return, and that there are monsters underneath it — and got both denials shouted at a wall.”</li><li><strong>Light Fingers</strong> — “Waluigi met Jory Dobbs for eighteen hours and can describe him completely: cheap boots with good laces, a woollen hat that did not survive the cave, a kit-bag containing sandwiches, a spare shirt, one stolen passport”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/jory_dobbs</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/jory_dobbs</code>.</p><p><em>Promoted from an NPC statblock to a player character sheet on 2026-11-20 (Waluipedia sheets suite). Fighter 3 (Champion), Human, background Hireling.</em></p><ul><li>Fighter (Champion) read off the record: hired off a noticeboard, swings a club, loud, light-fingered.</li><li>Level 3, as his record's ledger line gives it.</li><li>Standard array: STR 15, CON 14, DEX 13, CHA 12, WIS 10, INT 8.</li><li>The world's Jory Dobbs NPC statblock stays as it is; this is a second, player-run sheet.</li></ul>",
        "public": ""
      },
